  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conference support &quot;Our Common Future under       Climate Change&quot; Paris 7-10 July 2015 - Conference support &quot;Our Common Future under Climat</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konferensst&#xf6;d &quot;Our Common Future under Climate    Change&quot; Paris 7-10 juli 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

7-10 juli 2015 h&#xe5;lls en vetenskapliga konferensen &quot;Our Common Future Under Climate Change&quot; i Paris, Frankrike. Konferensen organiseras av bl.a. ICSU, Unesco och franska myndigheter och kommer att bidra med kunskap inf&#xf6;r UNFCC COP 21 i Paris i december 2015. Sidas insats syftar till att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra att ca 25 forskare fr&#xe5;n l&#xe5;ginkomstl&#xe4;nder kan delta i konferensen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to enable the participation of approx 50 scientists from low  income countries in the major international scientific conference      Our Common Future under Climate Change at UNESCO, 7-10 July 2015.     The conference will provide essential scientific input to COP 21      The 21st Conference of the Parties to the United Nations Framework   Convention on Climate Change in Paris in December 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
